---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    seo={{
        title: "Virtual Influencers Analysis — Inmaculada Osuna",
        description: "PLS-SEM structural equation modeling for business metrics extraction.",
    }}
>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto antialiased">
        <div>
            <a href="/en/projects" class="text-sm font-semibold text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Back to Projects
            </a>
        </div>

        <header class="flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-8">
            <div class="mb-5">
                <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-orange-600 bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-full dark:bg-orange-900/20 dark:text-orange-400 dark:border-orange-800/50">DATA SCIENCE & PLS-SEM</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
                Virtual Influencers Analysis
            </h1>
            
            <span class="text-base font-medium text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5zm0 0v7"></path></svg>
                Master's Thesis (TFM) — University of Granada[cite: 3]
            </span>
            
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                Analysis of the impact and consumer perception of Virtual Influencers through market research design and structural equation modeling[cite: 3].
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-orange-500">◆</span> Study Design
                </h3>
                <p>
                    With the rise of AI-generated influencers, quantifying how these entities alter consumer behavior compared to human counterparts became vital. The project covered everything from survey design and primary data collection to advanced statistical processing.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-orange-500">◆</span> Statistical Modeling (PLS-SEM)
                </h3>
                <p>
                    To analyze complex relationships among latent variables (such as brand trust, purchase intent, and engagement), Partial Least Squares Structural Equation Modeling <strong>(PLS-SEM)</strong> was applied[cite: 3].
                </p>
                <p>
                    The entire data cleaning, transformation, and exploratory analysis workflow was coded in <strong>R</strong>, making extensive use of the <strong>Tidyverse</strong> ecosystem to extract actionable business insights for digital marketing campaigns.
                </p>
            </section>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">R</span>
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Tidyverse</span>
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Multivariate Statistics</span>
                <span class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">PLS-SEM</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>